@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Caller
component ServiceClient
component "Service Executor\n(one Tokio task)" as Executor
component "Service::handle" as Handle
database "Service core metadata" as Metadata
collections "TaskSet\nFuturesUnordered" as Tasks
component "Child ServiceClient" as Child

Caller --> ServiceClient : call / submit
ServiceClient --> Executor : business mpsc
Executor --> Handle : direct call
Handle --> Metadata : short domain methods
Handle --> Executor : Reply or TaskSpec
Executor --> Tasks : insert and poll
Tasks --> Child : TaskContext::call
Executor --> Caller : oneshot / TaskTicket
@enduml
